1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.718
This video demonstrates how to assess neurovision and dispense glasses.

2
00:00:04.718 --> 00:00:08.020
Wash your hands and don't pee pee.

3
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:12.737
You'll need a neurovision chart, pen and clinical notes, range

4
00:00:12.737 --> 00:00:17.455
of reading glasses and a 40cm long piece of string.

5
00:00:17.455 --> 00:00:21.700
Explain what you're going to do in gain consent.

6
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.475
Sit the patient comfortably in a well-lit place.

7
00:00:25.475 --> 00:00:32.551
Use a string to make sure the chart is held at the correct 40cm distance.

8
00:00:32.551 --> 00:00:37.740
Ask them to read down the chart with both eyes together.

9
00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:42.500
Record the smallest line they can read comfortably.

10
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:49.220
If they cannot read the N8 line, then try with plus 1.5 diopter sphere glasses.

11
00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:53.376
If they still can read N8, then use the next higher power, and so

12
00:00:53.376 --> 00:00:54.860
on, until they can comfortably

13
00:00:54.860 --> 00:00:57.540
read N8 text.

14
00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:00.660
Make sure the glass is fiddle-k and the patient is happy with their appearance.
